{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 20 years of eating nothing but porridge, Hank decides to collect ingredients for a nice tasty soup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple side-scroller where the goal of each stage is to pick up the soup ingredient at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 3 soups to collect ingredients for, each with a unique set of levels, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -Leek &amp; Potato soup, set in Onion Forest, teeming with curious wildlife </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -Lobster Bisque, set in Crab Coast, where soft sands border a shimmering ocean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -Pumpkin soup, set in Pumpkin Hollow, a dark haunted valley where few dare to venture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 8 challenges to complete per soup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlockable game modes including time trial mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Level editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created entirely by me, Sean T.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2203890?t=1768310123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768310123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203890/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768310123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203890/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768310123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 20 years of eatin